{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Between dream and death, a soul awakens\u2014trapped in the body of a cursed wolf.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/c3dcad90e56e213d59863e5bf1e377e5.poster.avif?t=1769330108\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/c3dcad90e56e213d59863e5bf1e377e5.webm?t=1769330108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/c3dcad90e56e213d59863e5bf1e377e5.mp4?t=1769330108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey across mist-shrouded islands, storm-torn ruins, and ancient living forests where powerful spirits take form.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/459aa51e847d843bfd6287c3152f72b8.poster.avif?t=1769330108\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/459aa51e847d843bfd6287c3152f72b8.webm?t=1769330108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/459aa51e847d843bfd6287c3152f72b8.mp4?t=1769330108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As fragments of forgotten memory resurface, you\u2019ll uncover the truth behind the curse that binds you\u2014and confront what you\u2019ve become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Daemon</i>\u00a0is a\u00a0<strong>mythic action RPG</strong>  blending <strong> narrative storytelling</strong> and\u00a0<strong>atmospheric exploration </strong>with<strong> souls-like combat\u00a0</strong>with <strong>visceral action</strong>. Battle corrupted beasts, outwit spectral guardians, and master dual forms to uncover the world\u2019s hidden truths. Guided by spirits both kind and cruel, your choices will shape a <strong>journey of memory and rebirth</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/cc8436a3e057e7b98b97b71f7342a33c.avif?t=1769330108\" width=87 height=95 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3a <strong>Dual-Form Combat</strong><br>Shift between an agile <strong>wolf</strong> and a powerful <strong>were-form</strong> to overcome enemies, navigate terrain, and solve environmental puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/7991d5816eb95151f6317905633c4b9f.poster.avif?t=1769330108\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/7991d5816eb95151f6317905633c4b9f.webm?t=1769330108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/7991d5816eb95151f6317905633c4b9f.mp4?t=1769330108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf32 <strong>Mystical Exploration</strong><br>Traverse maze-like <strong>islands</strong> filled with living forests, hidden lore, and ancient spirits guarding deeper mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/008c852c1be8eabdd74ac2b4dc27282f.poster.avif?t=1769330108\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/008c852c1be8eabdd74ac2b4dc27282f.webm?t=1769330108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Boss Encounters</strong><br>Challenge corrupted <strong>guardians</strong> to claim their power, awaken new abilities, and uncover the story of the fallen realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/b02db7536dec812a75177f620b4d21f5.poster.avif?t=1769330108\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/b02db7536dec812a75177f620b4d21f5.webm?t=1769330108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/b02db7536dec812a75177f620b4d21f5.mp4?t=1769330108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Spirit Growth</strong> <br>Gather <strong>Wisdom</strong> from defeated spirits to evolve your forms, unlock new combat techniques, and reclaim fragments of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/2a7f4d9c2f0f822f75e08e71f9925197.poster.avif?t=1769330108\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/2a7f4d9c2f0f822f75e08e71f9925197.webm?t=1769330108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/2a7f4d9c2f0f822f75e08e71f9925197.mp4?t=1769330108